window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>We thought it was over. We were wrong.</b></p> <p>My father is alive, and he wants his research back—me.</p> <p>I am not a scared little girl anymore, and he will learn to fear the person he created with his twisted experiments.</p> <p>He thought he won. He believed he ruined us. He should know better...</p> <p>...because I'm <i>Unbreakable</i>.</p> <p>This is the second and final book in the Pretty Liars duet. Intended for mature listeners.</p>"; 
